# Bee Cee Logistics Ltd — Website Sitemap & Feature Plan

**Prepared for:** Bellion Chola & Songwe Kabonde
**Prepared by:** Tiki Chilomo
**Scope tier:** Tier 2 — Interactive site with client/admin dashboard

---

## 1. Public Site

### 1.1 Home
- Hero banner: "Logistics Our Game" — car hire, customs clearing, freight forwarding, removals, general supply
- Trust strip: client logos (National Assembly, Oxfam, PATH, CIHEB, GIZ, Stanbic, PwC, CHAZ, Catholic Relief Services, etc.)
- Compliance badges: ZPPA Registered, ZRA Tax Cleared, NAPSA Compliant, PACRA Incorporated
- Quick-access buttons: Request a Quote | WhatsApp Us | Track My Job
- Snapshot of fleet (photos, categorized)

### 1.2 About Us
- Company history (est. 2015, 28+ years combined industry experience)
- Mission / Vision / Quality Statement
- Provinces served (all 10)
- Leadership: Bellion Chola (CEO), Songwe Kabonde (Marketing Executive)

### 1.3 Services (parent page + 5 sub-pages, each SEO-targeted)
- **3.1 Car Hire** — self-drive & chauffeur-driven, staff shuttle/bus hire, school pickups/tours
- **3.2 Customs Clearing** — border town + international airport coverage
- **3.3 Freight Forwarding** — sea, road, air; door-to-door
- **3.4 Removals & Relocation** — pre-move survey, packing/crating, piano/heavy items, local + international
- **3.5 General Supply & Project Logistics Consultancy**

Each sub-page: description, process steps, relevant fleet, "Request a Quote" CTA specific to that service.

### 1.4 Fleet
- Filterable gallery: Saloon Cars | 4x4 | Buses | Trucks
- Vehicle specs (capacity, use case)
- Live availability indicator (pulled from admin calendar — "Available" / "Booked")

### 1.5 Our Clients
- Logo wall + short case-style blurbs (e.g., NGO condom distribution logistics for CHAZ, National Assembly committee touring)
- Builds procurement-officer confidence at a glance

### 1.6 Request a Quote
- Structured form: service type → dates → route/province → vehicle/cargo type → passenger/cargo volume → contact details
- Auto-generates PDF summary, emails to Bellion/Songwe + confirmation to client
- Feeds directly into Admin Dashboard as a new lead

### 1.7 Track My Job *(client-portal gate)*
- Enter PO/job reference number → see status (Quote Sent → Confirmed → In Progress → Cleared/Delivered → Completed)
- Optional login for full history (see 2.1)

### 1.8 Downloads
- Company Profile PDF
- Compliance certificates (ZRA, NAPSA, ZPPA, PACRA) — ready for tender submissions
- Bank confirmation letter (on request/behind form)

### 1.9 Contact
- Office address, phone numbers, email
- WhatsApp click-to-chat
- Simple contact form
- Google Maps embed (Musonda Ngosa Rd, Villa Elizabetha)

